#. [achievement]: id=dod_mp
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/achievements.cfg:48
msgid "Scenario 3: Mushroom Picking"
msgstr "场景 3：采蘑菇"

#. [achievement]: id=dod_mp
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/achievements.cfg:49
msgid "Harvest at least half of the mushroom groves in <i>Fateful Day</i>."
msgstr "在 <b>宿命之日</b> 中，采集至少一半的蘑菇林。"

#. [achievement]: id=dod_hb
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/achievements.cfg:56
msgid "Scenario 3: Hiss Battle"
msgstr "场景3：嘶鸣之战"

#. [achievement]: id=dod_hb
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/achievements.cfg:57
msgid ""
"Attack the Blue Blood Saurian leader with Refumee in <i>Fateful Day</i>."
msgstr "在 <b>宿命之日</b> 中，使用瑞富米攻击蓝血蜥蜴人首领。"

#. [scenario]: id=00_Being_Born
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:5
msgid "Being Born"
msgstr "降生"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:20
msgid ""
"The Heart Mountains have the word Heart in their name for a reason. This is "
"the largest mountain range in the known world, forming a natural wall that "
"splits the Northlands in two."
msgstr ""
"心之山脉得名为“心”，实乃有其深意。此乃已知世界中最庞大的山峦，宛若一道天然高"
"墙，将北陆一分为二。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:24
msgid ""
"This vast expanse of craggy hills and mountain peaks is home to many "
"dwarves, who are usually engrossed in a feverish search for ever rarer ores, "
"or else getting themselves drunk on honey."
msgstr ""
"在这片广袤的嶙峋山丘与巍峨峰峦之中，栖息着众多的矮人。他们或是沉迷于对罕见矿"
"石的狂热搜寻，或是沉溺于蜂蜜的醉意之中。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:28
msgid ""
"Other creatures also live in the shadows of the dark caves and earthy "
"grottos. Creatures great and terrible in appearance, but naive in nature, "
"and easy to manipulate."
msgstr ""
"在幽暗洞穴与泥土石窟的阴影之下，还栖息着其他生灵。它们外表庞大可怖，本性却极"
"其天真，极易受人摆布。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:32
msgid ""
"These are trolls. They are often thought of as beasts, bloodthirsty monsters "
"who only do bad things, but this is not true at all. As I have said before, "
"they are merely naive... and perhaps sometimes a little bit too reckless."
msgstr ""
"这些就是巨魔。世人常误以为它们是野兽，嗜血的怪物，只知作恶，但这绝非真相。正"
"如旧话所说，它们生性纯真……也许有时太过鲁莽。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:37
msgid ""
"The story I am about to tell you happened sixteen years after we, humans, "
"first came to the Great Continent. This is a story of the evil that pursued "
"us here, and the sadness that has come to the trolls..."
msgstr ""
"我即将讲述的故事，发生在我们，人类，初次踏足这片泰陆的十六年之后。这是关于曾"
"紧追我们而来的邪恶，亦有关于降临于巨魔之身……那深重的哀伤。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:39
msgid "Crelanu the Wise"
msgstr "智者克雷拉努"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:51
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:48
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:43
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:68
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:41
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:111
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:45
msgid "Golden Flame Tribe"
msgstr "金焰部落"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:63
msgid "Newborn"
msgstr "初生者"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:73
msgid "One day in the Heart Mountains."
msgstr "一日，于心之山脉。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:99
msgid "In a silent moment, a stone wall came to life."
msgstr "于无声之时，石壁化灵。"

#. [unit]: type=Strong Troll Whelp, id=OL_PROLOG
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:107
msgid "Nameless Troll"
msgstr "无名巨魔"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:124
msgid "...And it suddenly shattered."
msgstr "……然后，它骤然崩裂。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:141
msgid ""
"The newborn troll began to crawl. He moved very slowly. It was as if he was "
"still dreaming, or as if his inner flame had only just begun to warm."
msgstr ""
"初生的巨魔开始爬行。他移动得极慢。仿佛他仍在梦境之中，又仿佛他的内焰方才初"
"暖。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:168
msgid ""
"With each step, his flame of life grew stronger. The troll’s heart shimmered "
"with golden light."
msgstr "每一步迈出，他生命的火焰便更盛一分。巨魔之心，泛起金色的微光。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:188
msgid "The newborn wanted to roar, but he knew no words."
msgstr "那初生者渴望咆哮，却不知任何言语。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:242
msgid "Turning, the newborn realized he was alone."
msgstr "转身之际，初生者蓦然惊觉，这世间唯有孤影。"

#. [message]: speaker=OL_PROLOG
#. [message]: speaker=OL
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:247
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:839
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:670
msgid "..."
msgstr "……"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:258
msgid "He tried again to speak and... This time he succeeded."
msgstr "他再次尝试开口……而这一次，他成功了。"

#. [message]: speaker=OL_PROLOG
#. [message]: speaker=OL
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:267
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:208
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:715
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:527
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:1091
msgid "Ougl!!"
msgstr "奥格尔！！"

#. [modify_unit]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:274
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/utils/characters.cfg:6
msgid "Ougl Firstborn"
msgstr "初生者奥格尔"

#. [message]: speaker=OL_PROLOG
#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. [message]: speaker=OL
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:291
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:696
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:767
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:361
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:883
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:306
msgid "...?"
msgstr "……？"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:337
msgid "New motion suddenly disturbed the underground calm."
msgstr "忽有异动，骤然惊破了地底深处的幽寂。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:360
msgid ""
"As if prompted by Ougl’s roar, other trolls also awoke from their sleep."
msgstr "仿佛受到奥格尔的咆哮的召唤，其他的巨魔也从沉睡中苏醒。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/00_Being_Born.cfg:397
msgid "This is how trolls are born."
msgstr "巨魔，便是如此诞生。"

#. [scenario]: id=01_First_Steps
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:5
msgid "First Steps"
msgstr "启程"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:27
msgid "As the first awakened, Ougl became the leader of his tribe."
msgstr "奥格尔率先觉醒，遂成其部落之首。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:31
msgid ""
"The children of stone moved forward. Their path — not an easy one — led "
"through intricate corridors deep underground. They did not know light, for "
"it never reached these deep places. The air was cold."
msgstr ""
"石之子民向前而行。前路——并非坦途——蜿蜒于幽深地底错综的廊道间。他们不知何为光"
"明，因那光辉从未抵达这般深处。空气凛冽。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:36
msgid ""
"When the Golden Flame Tribe (as I will henceforth call them) entered tunnels "
"that had once belonged to the bearded race, one of the trolls began to "
"behave quite unusually."
msgstr ""
"当金焰部落（且在此将其如此称之）踏入那曾属于胡须之族的隧道之时，其中一只巨魔"
"的行径竟变得极为反常。"

#. [side]
#. [unit]: type=Fire Guardian, id=IF
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:71
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:390
msgid "Inner Flame"
msgstr "内焰"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:104
msgid "Ash Flame Tribe"
msgstr "灰焰部落"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:132
msgid "Cave Dwellers"
msgstr "洞穴居民"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:163
msgid "Defeat the Inner Flame and Ash Flame leaders"
msgstr "击败内焰与灰焰首领"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:167
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:170
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1152
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:295
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:645
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:96
msgid "Death of Ougl"
msgstr "奥格尔死亡"

#. [unit]: type=Troll Whelp, id=AU
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:226
msgid "Arru"
msgstr "阿鲁"

#. [unit]: type=Troll Whelp, id=GO
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:243
msgid "Gao"
msgstr "高"

#. [unit]: type=Troll Whelp, id=NM
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:260
msgid "Nuum"
msgstr "努姆"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:277
msgid "Suddenly, one of the trolls began to behave strangely."
msgstr "忽然，一名巨魔举止变得怪异。"

#. [unit]: type=Troll Whelp, id=UG
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:283
msgid "Strange Troll"
msgstr "怪异的巨魔"

#. [message]: speaker=UG
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:357
msgid "Ullg!!"
msgstr "乌尔格！！"

#. [modify_unit]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:384
msgid "Ullg the Flameless"
msgstr "无焰者乌尔格"

#. [message]: speaker=IF
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:440
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:818
msgid "S s s s...!"
msgstr "嘶——嘶——嘶——嘶……！"

#. [message]: speaker=OL
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:479
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1268
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:614
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/utils/defeat.cfg:27
msgid "Ougl?"
msgstr "奥格尔？"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:635
msgid "H i s s...!"
msgstr "嘶……！"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:702
msgid "The finder of the mysterious egg made a decision without much thought."
msgstr "发现了那枚神秘之蛋的生灵，并未多加思索，便已做出了抉择。"

#. [unit]: type=Fire Ant, id=LA
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:736
msgid "Lonely Ant"
msgstr "孤蚁"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:773
msgid ""
"There are many unexplainable things in this world. This is one of them: the "
"little ant decided to join the trolls."
msgstr "世间多有不可解之事。此便是其一：那只孤独的蚂蚁，竟决意投身于巨魔之列。"

#. [message]: speaker=UG
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:830
msgid "Ullg...!"
msgstr "乌尔格……！"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:845
msgid ""
"Ougl has learned how to control his inner flame. You can now recruit <b>Fire "
"Guardians</b>."
msgstr "奥格尔已学会控制其内焰。现在你可以征募<b>烈火卫士</b>了。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:856
msgid ""
"Also... some of the trolls, like their leader, began to feel a mysterious "
"connection to fire. You can now recruit <b>Troll Initiates</b>."
msgstr ""
"此外……部分巨魔，正如他们的领袖一般，亦开始与火焰萌生一种神秘的羁绊。现在你已"
"能征募<b>巨魔学徒</b>了。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:874
msgid ""
"There is an open trapdoor in the ruined dwarven castle. Do you want to go "
"through it and play the bonus puzzle level?"
msgstr ""
"在破败的矮人城堡废墟中，有一扇敞开的活板门。\n"
"你是否愿穿越其下，挑战那奖励谜题关卡？"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:876
msgid "I will play the bonus puzzle scenario."
msgstr "我要玩这个奖励谜题场景。"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/01_First_Steps.cfg:887
msgid "I don’t want to play the bonus puzzle scenario."
msgstr "我不想玩这个奖励谜题场景。"

#. [scenario]: id=02_A_Dream
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:5
msgid "A Dream"
msgstr "一场梦"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:22
msgid ""
"Soon Ougl saw that they had come to a dead end. The way forward was blocked "
"by rock and stone."
msgstr "不久，奥格尔便发觉它们来到了一处绝路。岩石与石壁堵塞了前路。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:26
msgid ""
"There were two options. The trolls could either turn back the way they came "
"or... break through."
msgstr "眼前有两条路。巨魔们要么转身折返，要么……破壁前行。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:31
msgid "Of course, they chose the latter."
msgstr "当然，他们选择了后者。"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:74
msgid "Grove Guardians"
msgstr "树丛守护者"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:99
msgid "Emmm the Oak"
msgstr "橡树·埃姆姆"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:100
msgid "Ummm the Birch"
msgstr "桦树·乌姆姆"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:101
msgid "Immm the Linden"
msgstr "椴树·伊姆姆"

#. [unit]: type=Wose Shaman, id=OM
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:106
msgid "Ommm the Oldest"
msgstr "最古者·奥姆姆"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:166
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1148
msgid "Survive until turns run out"
msgstr "存活至回合耗尽"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:180
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1166
msgid ""
"If a Fire Guardian or Fire Wraith moves on a forest or grass tile it will "
"partially burn down. Enter a tile twice to completely burn it down."
msgstr ""
"如果烈火卫士或火焰幽魂移动到了一个森林或草地地块，该地形将部分烧毁。进入同一"
"个地块两次即可完全烧毁。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:184
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1170
msgid ""
"The grove area has a special time of day: Mystic Light, which gives lawful "
"units bonus +25%, and chaotic -25%."
msgstr ""
"树丛区域拥有独特的时段：神秘之光，赋予守序单位+25%的增益，混沌单位-25%的减"
"益。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:188
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1174
msgid "Woses teleport from the castle through the Great Trees."
msgstr "树人透过巨树从城堡中传送而出。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:234
msgid ""
"Now that Ougl was able to control his inner flame, he could easily break "
"through stone walls."
msgstr "如今，奥格尔已能驾驭其内焰，那坚硬的石墙，在他面前也如薄冰般易碎。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:363
msgid "First the stone wall was heated, and then Ougl smashed it."
msgstr "先是石壁被烈火灼热，随后奥格尔将其轰碎。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:369
msgid "I have no idea why such a thing should work, but it made sense to Ougl."
msgstr "我不知这般做法为何竟能奏效，但奥格尔却觉得理所当然。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:625
msgid ""
"Ougl broke through the rocks again and again until he opened a way to a very "
"mysterious place."
msgstr "奥格尔一次次凿穿岩层，直至为他开辟出一条通往隐秘之境的道路。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:631
msgid ""
"They were no longer as deep underground as before and the darkness was not "
"as thick."
msgstr "他们已不再如往昔般深埋于地下，夜色亦不再浓重如墨。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:721
msgid ""
"Ougl loved this strange new green color, and there was plenty of it here."
msgstr "奥格尔钟爱这抹奇异的新生翠绿，而此处，这抹绿意正铺天盖地。"

#. [unit]: type=Wose, id=AM
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:732
msgid "Ammm the Maple"
msgstr "枫树·阿姆姆"

#. [message]: speaker=AM
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:757
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1253
msgid "A m m m...?"
msgstr "阿——姆——姆——姆……？"

#. [message]: speaker=AM
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:786
msgid "A m m m...!"
msgstr "阿——姆——姆——姆……！"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:792
msgid ""
"Ougl could not guess what the leafy creature might want from him and his "
"brothers, for Ougl could not speak or understand the language of other "
"beings. He only knew feelings and emotions."
msgstr ""
"奥格尔无从揣测那木叶生灵欲求何物，毕竟他不通人言，亦不解异族心声。他只知晓感"
"受与情感。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:803
msgid ""
"...And from moment to moment he felt more and more anger from the tree folk, "
"which waved its branches menacingly at the nearby Fire Wraith."
msgstr ""
"……而一刻刻间，他感到那树人身上的怒意愈积愈浓，那树人正朝近旁的火焰幽魂威胁地"
"挥舞着枝条。"

#. [message]: speaker=OL
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:817
msgid "Ougl...?"
msgstr "奥格尔……？"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:833
msgid "There was nothing left for the trolls to do but defend themselves."
msgstr "巨魔们别无选择，唯有自卫。"

#. [unit]: type=Wild Saurian, id=RE
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1076
msgid "Refumee the Swampling"
msgstr "沼泽行者·瑞富米"

#. [message]: speaker=RE
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1098
msgid "S y s y...!"
msgstr "嘶——嘶……！"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1109
msgid ""
"The Saurian’s speech meant nothing to Ougl, but Ougl felt that he could "
"trust and rely on her. He felt that the swamp dweller was not hostile and "
"wanted to support him."
msgstr ""
"蜥蜴人的言语对奥格尔而言毫无意义，但他心中却泛起一股信任与依托之感。他感知到"
"这位沼泽栖居者并无敌意，反倒怀有扶持他的心意。"

#. [message]: speaker=RE
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1121
msgid "S y s y..."
msgstr "嘶——嘶……"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1137
msgid ""
"The young trolls spotted a huge tree within the underground forest. This was "
"one of the great woses, the guardians of the grove, and it glared menacingly "
"at the stone creatures who it believed were threatening saplings."
msgstr ""
"年轻的巨魔们在地下森林中发现了一棵参天巨木。那是树丛的守护者之一，一位伟大的"
"树人。它怒视着这些石之生灵，深信它们正威胁着幼嫩的树苗。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1143
msgid ""
"Ougl was quick to guess that the death of any Elder Wose would only further "
"enrage the treefolk, and resolved to keep his distance from them."
msgstr ""
"奥格尔敏锐地洞悉：任何树人长者的死亡，只会令树族更加狂怒。于是，他决意远离它"
"们，不敢有半分逾矩。"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1156
msgid "Death of any of the Elder Woses located on the Great Trees"
msgstr "任何位于巨树上的树人长者死亡"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1188
msgid ""
"With the death of one of the three great guardians of the grove, the woses "
"went into a frenzy. The trolls, helpless in the face of these strange new "
"creatures, knew it was their end."
msgstr ""
"三大树丛守护者之一既殒，众树人陷入狂乱。巨魔们，面对这些陌生新造之物，束手无"
"策，深知末路已至。"

#. [message]: speaker=OM
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1242
msgid "O m m m...!!"
msgstr "奥——姆——姆——姆……！！"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1248
msgid ""
"As the sound of battle echoed through the grove, a great old tree finally "
"began to stir."
msgstr "战声回荡林间，一株古老巨树终于开始苏醒。"

#. [message]: speaker=OM
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1263
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1273
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1353
msgid "O m m m..."
msgstr "奥——姆——姆——姆……"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1316
msgid ""
"The awakened Wose Shaman spoke to Ougl in a strange way, and Ougl "
"understood. The Wose’s name was Ommm, and it was the leader of the tree folk."
msgstr ""
"那苏醒的树人萨满以奇异的方式与奥格尔低语，而奥格尔心领神会。那树人的名字唤作"
"奥姆姆，它乃是树族的至高领袖。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1327
msgid ""
"Ommm used a mysterious magic to see the purpose of the troll’s journey, and "
"whether they had evil intentions towards the green grove."
msgstr ""
"奥姆姆施展了神秘的魔法，窥见了巨魔此行究竟为何，以及他们对这片翠绿的林地是否"
"怀有恶念。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1333
msgid ""
"It soon realized that the trolls were not to blame for the unfortunate "
"skirmish."
msgstr "它很快便明白，那场不幸的遭遇战，巨魔并非始作俑者。"

#. [message]: speaker=OM
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1338
msgid "O m m m...?"
msgstr "奥——姆——姆——姆……？"

#. [message]: speaker=OL
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1348
msgid "Ougl..."
msgstr "奥格尔……"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1359
msgid ""
"Ougl wanted to travel further upwards, but the Wose Shaman advised him "
"against it. The woses warned that the surface held many creatures who were "
"not guided by goodness of heart, but by the law of strength."
msgstr ""
"奥格尔渴望向更高处攀登，而树人萨满却出言相诫。树人们警告他，地表之上生灵众"
"多，它们并不遵循善心的指引，而唯信强权之理。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1365
msgid ""
"But Ougl had seen green lands now, and he began to dream of seeing more. The "
"higher he climbed, the more green there would be."
msgstr ""
"然而，奥格尔已见过那片翠绿的大地，心中由此萌生了探寻更广阔绿意的渴望。他攀登"
"得越高，那抹绿色便愈显丰盈。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1382
msgid ""
"After some thought, the Wose Shaman agreed to give the trolls directions to "
"the surface. But the trolls were to first plant new trees in place of the "
"ones that had fallen during the battle."
msgstr ""
"经过一番思量，树人萨满终于同意为巨魔们指明通往地表的方向。但巨魔们须先栽种新"
"木，以弥补战斗中倒下的树木。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/02_A_Dream.cfg:1391
msgid ""
"After some thought, the Wose Shaman agreed to give the trolls directions to "
"the surface, but again warned Ougl that sometimes dreams are better left in "
"the realm of dreams."
msgstr ""
"经过一番思量，树人萨满终于同意为巨魔们指明通往地表的方向，却再次告诫奥格尔："
"有些梦境，终究该留在梦中。"

#. [scenario]: id=03_Fateful_Day
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:5
msgid "Fateful Day"
msgstr "宿命之日"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:27
msgid ""
"The Wose Shaman, as promised, told the trolls where they should go to get "
"out of the caves."
msgstr "树人萨满，正如他所许诺的，向巨魔指引了走出洞穴的道路。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:31
msgid ""
"It also put a peculiar charm on Ougl, allowing him to understand the speech "
"of other beings despite not knowing how to speak himself."
msgstr "这亦赋予奥格尔一种奇异的魅惑，令他虽无法言语，却能听懂万灵之声。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:35
msgid ""
"The trolls soon left the woses and continued on their journey. The going was "
"difficult, for the rocks they now climbed were very earthy and crumbly."
msgstr ""
"巨魔们不久便告别了树人，继续他们的旅程。前路坎坷，因为他们此刻攀爬的，皆是泥"
"土混杂、一触即碎的顽石。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:39
msgid ""
"There was also less food than on the deeper levels. The trolls found only "
"mushrooms, and Ougl disliked mushrooms. But this did not discourage him, for "
"Ougl now had a dream and a goal for his trek."
msgstr ""
"此处食物也比更深层的洞穴更为稀少。巨魔们只寻得些蘑菇，而奥格尔并不喜欢蘑菇。"
"但这并未让他气馁，因为此刻的奥格尔，心中已有梦想，征途已有目标。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:43
msgid "Despite their incautious nature, trolls are not simple at all."
msgstr "尽管他们行事鲁莽，巨魔绝非懵懂无知。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:47
msgid ""
"When they tame their inner flame, they move in the realm of feelings and can "
"guess the intentions of others without the need for speech."
msgstr "当他们驯服其内焰，便步入情感之境，无需言语，便能揣度他者之心。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:51
msgid ""
"Ougl and his friends knew from the beginning that the tree folk were not "
"evil, and they did not understand why the trees decided to attack them. If "
"the trolls had done nothing wrong, then why were they attacked?"
msgstr ""
"奥格尔及其挚友自始至终明白，树族并非邪恶，他们也无法理解树木为何决定向他们发"
"起攻击。倘若巨魔未曾行恶，为何招致如此痛击？"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:56
msgid ""
"The Golden Flame Tribe thought for a long time about what had happened and "
"what might yet happen. After much travel and much thought, they happened "
"across an underground lake."
msgstr ""
"金焰部落沉思良久，思索过往所历与未来将临。历经漫长跋涉与无尽思虑，他们最终遇"
"到了一处地下湖泊。"

#. [side]: type=Naga Warrior, id=SA, gender=female
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:89
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:58
msgid "Purple Eye Naga"
msgstr "紫眼娜迦"

#. [side]: type=Naga Warrior, id=SA, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:94
msgid "Sessa Purple Eye"
msgstr "紫眼塞莎"

#. [side]: type=Naga Warrior, id=SA, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:125
msgid "Irxa"
msgstr "伊尔克莎"

#. [side]: type=Naga Warrior, id=SA, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:126
msgid "Neillei"
msgstr "妮莱"

#. [side]: type=Naga Warrior, id=SA, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:127
msgid "Oaserss"
msgstr "奥瑟尔斯"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=AR
#. [side]: type=Goblin Pillager, id=NG
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:150
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:197
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:86
msgid "Red Cry Horde"
msgstr "红嚎部落"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=AR
#. [unit]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=AR
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:156
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:276
msgid "Agnar Red Cry"
msgstr "红嚎阿格纳"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=AR
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:182
msgid "Omag"
msgstr "奥玛格"

#. [side]: type=Goblin Pillager, id=NG
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:203
msgid "Nuug The Firebug"
msgstr "火虫努格"

#. [side]: type=Goblin Pillager, id=NG
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:229
msgid "Uod"
msgstr "乌德"

#. [side]: type=Goblin Pillager, id=NG
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:230
msgid "Marl"
msgstr "马尔"

#. [side]: type=Saurian Oracle, id=MZ
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:245
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:98
msgid "Blue Blood Saurians"
msgstr "蓝血蜥蜴人"

#. [side]: type=Saurian Oracle, id=MZ
#. [unit]: type=Saurian Oracle, id=MZ
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:251
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:312
msgid "Moarxz Blue Blood"
msgstr "蓝血莫阿尔克兹"

#. [side]: type=Saurian Oracle, id=MZ
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:277
msgid "Zarx"
msgstr "扎克斯"

#. [side]: type=Saurian Oracle, id=MZ
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:278
msgid "Azzaris"
msgstr "阿扎里斯"

#. [side]: type=Saurian Oracle, id=MZ
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:279
msgid "Sonikss"
msgstr "索尼克斯"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:291
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:641
msgid "Defeat every enemy unit"
msgstr "击败每个敌方单位"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:299
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:649
msgid "Death of Sessa"
msgstr "塞莎死亡"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:308
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:658
msgid ""
"Ougl’s control over fire has improved. Fire guardians can now move faster in "
"cave terrain."
msgstr "奥格尔对火焰的掌控已然精进。烈火卫士如今可在洞穴地形中更快地移动。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:312
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:662
msgid "Ally and enemy guard units have 0 movement points."
msgstr "盟友与敌军的守卫单位均无移动力。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:351
msgid "Drums could be heard in the distance."
msgstr "远方，传来了鼓声。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:367
msgid "It didn’t take long for the trolls to understand what was happening."
msgstr "巨魔们很快便洞悉了眼前的一切。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:401
msgid ""
"Some creatures were about to attack some other creatures. Both creatures’ "
"appearances were strange and monstrous."
msgstr "一些生灵正要攻击另一些生灵。双方的外貌都古怪而可怖。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:407
msgid "However, Ougl could feel who was not driven by a good heart."
msgstr "然而，奥格尔能够感知到，心中不存善意的是谁。"

#. [message]: speaker=SA
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:417
msgid "<b>S s a s...! ?</b> (Another enemy!?)"
msgstr "<b>嘶—萨—嘶……</b>（又一个敌人！？）"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:430
msgid "Ougl shook his head in denial."
msgstr "奥格尔摇了摇头，断然拒绝。"

#. [message]: speaker=SA
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:435
msgid "<b>S s a s...?</b> (A friend, then?)"
msgstr "<b>嘶—萨—嘶……？</b>（那么，是朋友吗？）"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:448
msgid "Ougl nodded."
msgstr "奥格尔点了点头。"

#. [message]: speaker=AR
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:458
msgid ""
"<b>Arg-hah!</b> (There is no more hope for you. No matter how many help you, "
"death awaits you anyway.)"
msgstr ""
"<b>啊——哈！</b>（你们已经没有希望了。无论来多少帮手，死亡都等着你们。）"

#. [message]: speaker=MZ
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:468
msgid "<b>S y s s...!</b> (Give up your treasures and we will spare you!)"
msgstr "<b>嘶——嘶——嘶……！</b> (交出你们的财宝，我们就饶你们一命！)"

#. [message]: speaker=SA
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:473
msgid "<b>S s a s...!</b> (Never!)"
msgstr "<b>嘶—萨—嘶……</b>（休想！）"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:478
msgid "<b>Urg-hah!</b> (Then die!)"
msgstr "<b>呃——哈！</b>（那就死吧！）"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:496
msgid "The Nagini looked again at the trolls."
msgstr "那娜迦再次望向这些巨魔。"

#. [message]: speaker=SA
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:501
msgid "<b>S s a s...?</b> (Will you help us?)"
msgstr "<b>嘶—萨—嘶……</b>（你们会帮我们吗？）"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:514
msgid "Ougl said only one thing."
msgstr "奥格尔仅言一事。"

#. [message]: speaker=RE
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:547
msgid "<b>S y s y...!</b> (I want to fight too!)"
msgstr "<b>嘶——嘶……！</b>（我也想战斗！）"

#. [message]: speaker=RE
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:559
msgid "<b>S y s y...</b> (Let me deal with this one.)"
msgstr "<b>嘶——嘶……！</b>（让我来解决这一个。）"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. [message]: speaker=OL
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:619
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:1054
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:1073
msgid "...!"
msgstr "……！"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:630
msgid ""
"The hungry troll gorged itself on the mushrooms. They weren’t very tasty. "
"Could they have been poisonous?"
msgstr "饥饿的巨魔狼吞虎咽地嚼着蘑菇。那些东西并不怎么可口。难道它们有毒？"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:636
msgid "The troll suddenly feels an overwhelming rage."
msgstr "巨魔心中猛然腾起一股无可遏制的怒火。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:666
msgid ""
"In this scenario, trolls entering mushroom terrain will destroy the "
"mushrooms and gain berserk on their melee attacks."
msgstr "在本场景中，进入蘑菇地形的巨魔将摧毁蘑菇，并使其近战攻击获得狂暴效果。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:683
msgid ""
"Ougl bit into a piece of mushroom, but as soon as he tasted it, he spat it "
"out in disgust. He was not interested in rage."
msgstr "奥格尔咬下一口蘑菇，刚一尝便厌恶地吐了出来。他并不渴求狂怒。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:831
msgid ""
"Drums once again echoed through the cavern. Enemy reinforcements had arrived."
msgstr "鼓声再度在洞穴中回荡……敌方的援兵，到了。"

#. [message]: speaker=AR
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:857
msgid "<b>Arg-hah!</b> (I won’t lose!)"
msgstr "<b>啊——哈！</b>（我不会输！）"

#. [message]: speaker=AR
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:869
msgid "<b>Arg-hah!</b> (You’ll pay for this, you dirty troll!)"
msgstr "<b>啊——哈！</b>（你会为此付出代价的，你这肮脏的巨魔！）"

#. [message]: speaker=NG
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:895
msgid "<b>Urg-hah...</b> (No! I can’t die...)"
msgstr "<b>呃——哈……</b>（不！我不能死……）"

#. [message]: speaker=MZ
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:921
msgid "<b>S y s s...!</b> (Time to retreat!)"
msgstr "<b>嘶——嘶——嘶……！</b>（该撤退了！）"

#. [message]: speaker=SA
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:937
msgid "<b>S s a s...!</b> (What a coward!)"
msgstr "<b>嘶—萨—嘶……！</b> (真是个胆小鬼！)"

#. [message]: speaker=RE
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:949
msgid "<b>S y s y...</b> (Forgive me for falling...)"
msgstr "<b>嘶——嘶……</b>（宽恕我的坠落……）"

#. [message]: speaker=RE
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:968
msgid "<b>S y s y...</b> (You are a fool of a saurian.)"
msgstr "<b>嘶——嘶……</b> (你这愚蠢的蜥蜴人。)"

#. [message]: speaker=MZ
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:977
msgid "<b>S y s s...!</b> (No, you are. You saurian traitor!)"
msgstr "<b>嘶——嘶——嘶……！</b>（不，是你。蜥蜴人的叛徒！）"

#. [message]: speaker=RE
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:986
msgid "<b>S y s y...!</b> (You are, not me!)"
msgstr "<b>嘶——嘶……！</b>（你是，我不是！）"

#. [message]: speaker=MZ
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:1000
msgid "<b>S y s s...!</b> (You are annoying...)"
msgstr "<b>嘶——嘶——嘶……！</b>（你们真是……烦人……）"

#. [message]: speaker=RE
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:1014
msgid "<b>S y s y...</b> (You are more.)"
msgstr "<b>嘶——嘶……</b>（你更烦。）"

#. [message]: speaker=RE
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:1023
msgid "<b>S s s s y s y s s y y...!</b> (Saurian insult, no translation.)"
msgstr "<b>嘶嘶嘶嘶！嘶嘶……!</b>（蜥蜴人脏话，没翻译。）"

#. [message]: speaker=MZ
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:1032
msgid "<b>S y s s...</b> (How dare you!)"
msgstr "<b>嘶——嘶……</b> (你敢！)"

#. [message]: speaker=SA
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:1049
msgid "<b>S s a s...</b> (It’s over...)"
msgstr "<b>嘶—萨—嘶……</b>（结束了……）"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:1101
msgid ""
"Ougl gave a victorious roar as the last of his enemies fell to the ground."
msgstr "当最后一名敌人倒下之时，奥格尔发出了胜利的咆哮。"

#. [message]: speaker=SA
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:1111
msgid ""
"<b>S s a s...</b> (Thank you for your help. Without your aid we would have "
"been routed.)"
msgstr "<b>嘶—萨—嘶……</b>（感谢相助。若无你等援手，我军恐已溃散。）"

#. [message]: speaker=SA
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:1116
msgid "<b>S s a s...</b> (How can we repay you?)"
msgstr "<b>嘶—萨—嘶……</b>（我们该怎么报答你？）"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/03_Fateful_Day.cfg:1122
msgid "Ougl already knew how the Naga could help him."
msgstr "奥格尔已洞悉，娜迦将如何相助。"

#. [scenario]: id=04_A_Beautiful_World
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:5
msgid "A Beautiful World"
msgstr "美丽的世界"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:20
msgid ""
"Sessa asked the trolls how she could repay them for their help, but the "
"trolls did not know how to speak. They pointed upwards with their hands."
msgstr ""
"塞莎问巨魔们，她该如何回报他们的帮助，可巨魔们不懂言语。他们只是抬起手，指向"
"上方。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:24
msgid ""
"Fortunately, this was not the first time the Nagas had met their kind, and "
"after a while they understood where the trolls were going."
msgstr "幸而，娜迦族并非初次邂逅此般生灵，没过多久，它们便知晓巨魔们意欲何往。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:29
msgid ""
"The old wose’s directions had been too complicated for Ougl to follow. He "
"had forgotten most of them already. But with a guide, the trolls would "
"surely reach their goal."
msgstr ""
"老树人指点的道路对奥格尔而言过于复杂。他早已遗忘大半。但有了向导，巨魔们定能"
"抵达目的地。"

#. [unit]: type=Naga Fighter, id=IA, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:64
msgid "Ilaja"
msgstr "伊拉娅"

#. [message]: speaker=IA
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:143
msgid "<b>S s a s...</b> (Here we bid farewell, stone friends. Be safe.)"
msgstr "<b>嘶—啊—嘶……！</b> (我们在此告别，石头朋友们。保重。)"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:167
msgid ""
"Ougl took a step towards the exit, but hesitated for a moment. He wasn’t "
"sure why."
msgstr "奥格尔向出口迈出一步，却迟疑了片刻。他不知为何。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:226
msgid ""
"The outside world was everything Ougl had imagined. Green. Full of sound and "
"life. Ougl and the Golden Flame Tribe were filled with awe."
msgstr ""
"外界的一切，皆如奥格尔所愿。苍翠。声响盈耳，生机盎然。奥格尔与金焰部落，皆为"
"之肃然起敬。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:248
msgid ""
"A bright light shone overhead, brighter than anything Ougl had ever seen. "
"The light hurt to look at. The light made everything hurt to look at, but "
"Ougl kept looking anyway."
msgstr ""
"头顶映照出刺目的光芒，那光之炽烈，乃奥格尔平生未睹。凝视它，灼痛难忍。那光令"
"万物皆在凝望中生出痛楚，然而，奥格尔依旧凝视着。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:262
msgid ""
"Ougl’s voice ran out with joy. He felt that he had fulfilled his greatest "
"dream."
msgstr "奥格尔的嗓音里流淌着无尽的欢愉。他感到自己已完成了最伟大的梦想。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:268
msgid "But his happiness did not last very long..."
msgstr "但这份喜悦并未持续太久……"

#. [message]: speaker=AR
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:294
msgid "<b>Arg-hah!</b> (Now we've got you! You dumb troll!)"
msgstr "<b>啊——哈！</b>（现在落到我们手里了！你这愚笨的巨魔！）"

#. [modify_side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:393
msgid "Flameless Tribe"
msgstr "无焰部落"

#. [modify_unit]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:401
msgid "Ougl the Flameless"
msgstr "无焰者奥格尔"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:484
msgid ""
"The saurian stole away Ougl’s inner flame and quenched it with magic. Bitter "
"cold cut into Ougl’s stone-like body."
msgstr ""
"蜥蜴人窃走了奥格尔体内的内焰，又以魔力将其浇灭。刺骨的严寒，无情地刺入了奥格"
"尔那如石般的躯体。"

#. [message]: speaker=MZ
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:489
msgid ""
"<b>S y s s...</b> (You will follow us wherever we go if you want to regain "
"your inner flame, troll.)"
msgstr "<b>嘶——嘶——嘶……</b>（如果你想重获内心的烈焰，就必须追随我们，巨魔。）"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:495
msgid "...But Ougl had no intention of giving up so easily."
msgstr "……但奥格尔并无如此轻易放弃的打算。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:501
msgid "He suddenly shouted. Trollish words rang out in the evening air."
msgstr "他突然大喊起来。巨魔的语言，在暮色中的空气里回荡。"

#. [message]: speaker=OL
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:510
msgid "OUGL... NOT FOLLOW YOU!!!"
msgstr "奥格尔……不——随——你——去！！！"

#. [message]: speaker=AR
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:553
msgid "<b>Arg-hah!</b> (The beast is trying to fight! Archers, to me!)"
msgstr "<b>啊——哈！</b>（这畜生还敢反抗！弓箭手，向我靠拢！）"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:640
msgid "When Ougl felt the heat of the fire, he flew into a great rage."
msgstr "当奥格尔触到那烈焰的灼热，他猛然陷入狂暴。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:906
msgid ""
"Ougl fell to his knees. The strong troll’s gaze became absent, and his will "
"to fight died out. His drive and vitality had faded away, and only empty "
"space remained in his heart."
msgstr ""
"奥格尔双膝跪地。这头强壮巨魔的目光变得空洞，战斗意志随之消亡。他的动力与活力"
"已然消散，心中只剩一片空洞。"

#. [message]: speaker=AR
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:913
msgid ""
"<b>Arg-hah!</b> (You have no chance to win against me. Do you understand? "
"Ha, ha, ha...!)"
msgstr "<b>啊——哈！</b> (你绝无胜算。听明白了吗？哈，哈，哈……！)"

#. [message]: speaker=AR
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:920
msgid ""
"<b>Arg-hah!</b> (Now your leader is under our power. You trolls need a new "
"leader. You will all follow us!)"
msgstr ""
"<b>啊——哈！</b>  (现在你们的首领已落入我辈之手。你们这些巨魔需要一位新的领"
"袖。你们所有人，都将追随我们！)"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:933
msgid ""
"None of the Golden Flame Tribe were as bright or as bold as Ougl had been. "
"They did not understand the danger of the orcs."
msgstr "金焰部落中，再无人如奥格尔那般明亮或果敢。他们未能洞见兽人的凶险。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:939
msgid ""
"The trolls joined their new leaders, and learned from them. They learned to "
"lust for the sheen of gold and the smell of blood. They learned to spread "
"ruin and death."
msgstr ""
"巨魔们追随了新的首领，并向他们学习。他们学会了渴望金子的光泽与血腥的气味。他"
"们学会了散布毁灭与死亡。"

#. [unit]: type=Elder Mage, id=CU
#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:1008
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:1041
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:1048
msgid "Crelanu"
msgstr "克雷拉努"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:1043
msgid ""
"Some years later, a few members of the unfortunate Golden Flame Tribe found "
"themselves in the far north, besieging my wizard’s tower as orcs so often do."
msgstr ""
"数年后，那不幸的金焰部落中的几位幸存者流落至极北之地，正如兽人常做的那样，包"
"围了我的巫师塔。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:1050
msgid ""
"Their attack failed. I took prisoners, from whom I learned this story. And "
"now you have learned it from me."
msgstr ""
"他们的攻势终归溃败。我生擒了俘虏，从他们口中得知了这段往事。而今，你也从我的"
"讲述中知晓了这一切。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/04_A_Beautiful_World.cfg:1062
msgid ""
"Trolls are often thought of as beasts, bloodthirsty monsters who only do bad "
"things. Perhaps many are. But many were not always so."
msgstr ""
"巨魔常被视作野兽，只会作恶的嗜血怪物。或许许多确是如此。但许多并非生来如此。"

#. [scenario]: id=Secret
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:5
msgid "Secret"
msgstr ""

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:20
msgid "Dwarves are a very cautious folk, carefully guarding their secrets."
msgstr "矮人乃极度谨慎之辈，将诸多秘辛严加守护。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:24
msgid ""
"They are well known for frantically mining treasures and adorning themselves "
"with jewels. Less well known is that they practice a mysterious kind of "
"magic."
msgstr ""
"他们因疯狂地挖掘宝藏、并以珠宝装饰自身而闻名遐迩。然而鲜为人知的是，他们还修"
"习着一种神秘的魔法。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:28
msgid ""
"It is said that when the earliest dwarves first came up from the deep, they "
"left behind a primordial power far below. Through the art of runes, dwarves "
"create energy channels that carry fragments of this power up to the surface "
"world."
msgstr ""
"据传，当最早的一批矮人从深渊中升起时，他们将一股原始的力量留在了极深之处。通"
"过符文之术，矮人们开辟了能量通道，将这股力量的碎片引向了地表世界。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:33
msgid ""
"Descending deeper through the trapdoor, Ougl became the first of the Golden "
"Flame Tribe to see this art in action."
msgstr ""
"随着他顺着陷阱门向下深入，奥格尔成为金焰部落中第一个亲眼见证这种艺术运作的巨"
"魔。"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:61
msgid "Guardian of the Secret Room"
msgstr "秘室守卫"

#. [side]
#. [unit]: type=Stone Golem, id=STONE-HEART
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:80
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:771
msgid "Stone Heart"
msgstr "石心"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:92
msgid "Reach the artifact (10,2)"
msgstr "抵达神器所在地 (10,2)"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:106
msgid ""
"The golem moves towards you each turn. It has 1 MP, which will increase by 1 "
"each time it enters a tile with a rune."
msgstr ""
"石魔像每回合朝你移动。它拥有 1 点移动力，每当它进入带有符文的格子时，其移动力"
"将会增加 1。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:110
msgid "To open the gate you need to trigger buttons: (5,7) and (15,7)."
msgstr "若要开启大门，你需要触发机关按钮：(5,7) 和 (15,7)."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:604
msgid ""
"The stone statue came suddenly to life. Its eyes lit up with a bright glow."
msgstr "石像骤然间焕发了生机。其双目闪烁着明亮的光芒。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:622
msgid ""
"Ougl was sure that there must be something very valuable locked away behind "
"the guardian statue. He wanted the treasure hidden by the dwarves."
msgstr ""
"奥格尔确信，在那守卫雕像之后，必定锁藏着某种极其珍贵之物。他渴望着矮人们埋藏"
"起来的宝藏。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:631
msgid "But first he had to open the way by pressing two stone buttons."
msgstr "但首先，他必须按下两枚石质按钮，以此开辟通路。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:652
msgid ""
"This amulet radiates an aura of power. It is engraved with the head of a "
"raven, birds that have been great allies of the dwarves since time "
"immemorial."
msgstr ""
"这枚护身符散发着力量的光晕。其上雕刻着渡鸦的头颅——自远古以来，此鸟便是矮人的"
"伟大盟友。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:711
msgid ""
"The moment Ougl’s fingers touch the amulet, the golem suddenly crumbles into "
"fine dust."
msgstr "就在奥格尔的手指触碰到护身符的那一瞬，石魔像骤然崩解，化作齑粉。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:765
msgid "Through the art of runes, the dust begins to gather again..."
msgstr "符文之艺，使尘埃再度聚集……"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:787
msgid "...and a new golem loyal to Ougl is born."
msgstr "……于是，一个效忠于奥格尔的新石魔像诞生了。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:900
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/scenarios/Secret.cfg:952
msgid "With a squeal of rusty machinery, the gate opens."
msgstr "伴随着锈蚀机械的刺耳尖叫，大门开启了。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Beast Saurian, race=lizard, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Beast_Saurian.cfg:5
msgid "Beast Saurian"
msgstr "野兽蜥蜴人"

#. [unit_type]: id=Beast Saurian, race=lizard, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Beast_Saurian.cfg:19
msgid ""
"As they grow older, Wild Saurians begin to be able to produce the poison "
"with which they coat their sickles. This allows them to weaken their prey, "
"which quickly falls under the strain of time."
msgstr ""
"随着年岁增长，野生蜥蜴人开始能够分泌出用于涂抹镰刀的毒液。借此，它们得以削弱"
"猎物的生机，使其在时间的重压下迅速倒下。"

#. [attack]: type=blade
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Beast_Saurian.cfg:29
msgid "poisonous sickle"
msgstr "毒镰刀"

#. [unit_type]: id=Great Stone Golem, race=monster
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Great_Stone_Golem.cfg:4
msgid "Great Stone Golem"
msgstr "巨石魔像"

#. [unit_type]: id=Great Stone Golem, race=monster
#. [unit_type]: id=Stone Golem, race=monster
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Great_Stone_Golem.cfg:17
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Stone_Golem.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Legends tell of great stone statues resembling dwarves that come to life "
"through the art of runes to protect the treasures of the bearded people."
msgstr "传说中，有巨大的石像，形如矮人，借符文之术而活，守护着长须之民的宝藏。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Great Stone Golem, race=monster
#. [unit_type]: id=Stone Golem, race=monster
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Great_Stone_Golem.cfg:19
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Stone_Golem.cfg:19
msgid "But these are just tales. Right?"
msgstr "但这些，仅仅是传说罢了。不是吗？"

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Great_Stone_Golem.cfg:42
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Initiate.cfg:28
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Stone_Golem.cfg:46
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Strong_Whelp.cfg:25
msgid "fist"
msgstr "拳头"

#. [unit_type]: id=Troll Initiate, race=troll
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Initiate.cfg:5
msgid "Troll Initiate"
msgstr "巨魔学徒"

#. [unit_type]: id=Troll Initiate, race=troll
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Initiate.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Some trolls are born smaller than the rest of their kin. Though weak in "
"body, they quickly realize that they have been blessed with an unusually "
"strong bond with fire."
msgstr ""
"有些巨魔出生时便比族人更为瘦小。尽管体魄孱弱，他们却能很快察觉，自己被赋予了"
"与火焰之间异常强烈的羁绊。"

#. [attack]: type=fire
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Initiate.cfg:37
msgid "flame tongue"
msgstr "烈焰之舌"

#. [unit_type]: id=Stone Golem, race=monster
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Stone_Golem.cfg:4
msgid "Stone Golem"
msgstr "石魔像"

#. [unit_type]: id=Strong Troll Whelp, race=troll
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Strong_Whelp.cfg:5
msgid "Strong Troll Whelp"
msgstr "强壮的巨魔幼崽"

#. [unit_type]: id=Strong Troll Whelp, race=troll
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Strong_Whelp.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Some Troll Whelps are stronger and larger than others. They are usually "
"found leading newly born troll tribes."
msgstr "有些巨魔幼崽比其他的更强壮、更庞大。它们通常是初生巨魔部落的首领。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Wild Saurian, race=lizard, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Wild_Saurian.cfg:5
msgid "Wild Saurian"
msgstr "野生蜥蜴人"

#. [unit_type]: id=Wild Saurian, race=lizard, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Wild_Saurian.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Some saurians are more savage and have a greater predatory instinct. They "
"often live alone and have developed a peculiar ability to heal themselves "
"from wounds and poisons."
msgstr ""
"部分蜥蜴人更为狂野，拥有更强烈的掠食本能。它们通常独居，并进化出了一种奇特的"
"异能，能够自我疗伤与解毒。"

#. [attack]: type=blade
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/units/Wild_Saurian.cfg:28
msgid "sickle"
msgstr "镰刀"

#. [message]: speaker=OL
#: data/campaigns/Dusk_of_Dawn/utils/defeat.cfg:12
msgid "Ougl...!"
msgstr "奥格尔……！"

